---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ButtonLink from '../components/ButtonLink.astro';
import heroImage from '../assets/images/traverse-bay-boat-2.jpg';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home" description="Payroll handled by people you know and trust in Traverse City and Northern Michigan.">
	<section class="hero-panel hero-panel--image" style={`background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37, 37, 37, 0.85), rgba(37, 37, 37, 0.95)), url(${heroImage.src});`}>
		<div>
			<h1>Payroll handled by people you know and trust</h1>
			<p>Integrated Payroll is based in Traverse City, built around relationships with accountants, advisors, and businesses across Northern Michigan.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="section">
		<div class="container split">
			<div>
				<h2>Payroll handled by people<br />you know and trust</h2>
				<p>Most of the businesses we work with did not find us online. They were introduced to us.</p>
				<p>Usually by a CPA. Sometimes by a bookkeeper. Other times by a business advisor who knew someone dealing with payroll headaches.</p>
				<p>That is how most of our relationships begin. Someone says, "You should give Jon or Andrew a call." And from there we take care of the rest.</p>
				<p>Integrated Payroll is based here in Traverse City, and a lot of our work comes from the relationships we have built with accountants and advisors across Northern Michigan.</p>
				<p>When someone sends a client our way, we know they are trusting us with a relationship they worked hard to build.</p>
				<p>We take that seriously.</p>
				<ButtonLink href="/free-quote/" text="Give us a call and say hello! 231-935-0225" />
			</div>
			<div class="image-card"><img src="/assets/98.webp" alt="Integrated Payroll team member" width="500" height="625" /></div>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="section section--gray">
		<div class="container centered"><h2>Right here in Northern Michigan</h2></div>
	</section>
	<section class="section">
		<div class="container split">
			<div class="image-card"><img src="/assets/101.webp" alt="Integrated Payroll team member" width="500" height="625" /></div>
			<div>
				<h2>Built around trusted introductions</h2>
				<p>We work closely with CPAs, accounting firms, bookkeepers, and business advisors throughout the region. Many of them simply do not want to manage payroll every week.</p>
				<p>It is constant deadlines, compliance rules, questions from clients, and notices that show up unexpectedly. Payroll can quickly become something that takes time away from the work they actually want to focus on.</p>
				<p>That is where we step in. We handle the payroll side of things so the advisor can keep doing what they do best while knowing their client is in good hands.</p>
				<ButtonLink href="/cpa-contact-form/" text="If you have a client who needs payroll help, feel free to reach out." />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
